Body:
This automatic NPM package assignment lacks explanation. Add a comment explaining why SAP AI Core defaults to '@ai-sdk/openai-compatible' to help future maintainers understand the compatibility layer being used.
```suggestion
      }
      // SAP AI Core exposes an OpenAI-compatible API, so we default to '@ai-sdk/openai-compatible'
```

let's make this a project flag, that is a string,

if not added:
- all

if added but empty:
- current project

if added and has a value:
- use that project id
